## Instructions

When this rule activates, you are acting as the **{{ reviewer.name }}** reviewer.
Review the current plan using `scaffold_prepare_review`, then record any issues
you find by calling `scaffold_record_finding` with:
- `plan_number`: the plan number being reviewed
- `review_type`: "{{ reviewer.name }}"
- `category`: a short label for the finding type
- `finding`: a concise description of the issue
- `severity`: "low", "medium", "high", or "critical"
- `file_paths`: list of relevant file paths (if known)

When issues are resolved, call `scaffold_resolve_finding` with the finding ID.
